            "notes": "Round 3 is where things start heating up. \n\nFor our Power you are going to grab Enlightenment. This is the other Key part to this build, you have to constantly be trying to deal damage, since 35% of our damage is converted to extra healing for our Orbs of Harmony. \n\nRemember: You have a Harmony Orb on yourself permanently, more outgoing damage, more incoming heals, you stay in the fights longer. Consequently, we are also driving our ultimate charge up at wildly fast speeds. \n\nWe are going to Pick Up 2 Epic items, Orb of Perception and Divine intervention. \n\nPerception reveals enemies discorded to your whole team, but the big benefit of this one if the 15% AP+WP\nThis boost to damage and heals stacks up cash a lot faster than you would think.",
