            "notes": "Round 4\n\nGrab Nebula Conduit, this paired with Divine Intervention is the start of your obnoxious survivability. \n\nIf enemies are heavily stacked into ability power, you could grab teachers totem instead. Both are great options.\n\nIf the money allows, grab either Satya's Solution or Breezeborne Blessing. \n\nBreezeborne works great if you have comms, or a Mercy/Freja/Juno on your team. \n\"Airborne\" is surprisingly easy to achieve. and a 15% boost to healing on airborne allies goes a long way. \n\nEx: Tank is critical, slap that harmony orb on him, tell him to spam jump while you start pumping out damage into the enemy team, next thing you know tank is full health again.",
