            "notes": "Round 5\n\nGrab Instant Karma (Power) and Catalytic Crystal.\n\nThis will boost our Ult Charge rate and help us get a bit of cash for the last few items for round 6 and 7. \n\nInstant Karma paired with Nebula Conduit and Divine Intervention has a hilarious effect together to where it seems the harder you get hit, the faster you recover your health. \n\nEx: Soldier 76 at 80% AP Hits you with the double Helix rockets? You drop down to maybe 150HP for maybe a few frames, then immediately you are recovering your shields (Divine Intervention) and paired with our AP and Orb on us, you'll be back to full in 1-2 seconds. \n\nDo not be afraid to fight back at this point, the only scary thing is a high WP reaper or someone who does not miss headshots on Cass/Ashe",
